			"notes": "### Added\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.11, 26.1 and 26.2. Pick the file matching your version; the 26.1 file covers 26.1, 26.1.1 and 26.1.2.\n\n### Changed\n\n- New mod icon.\n- Minimum NeoForge on 1.21.1 is now 21.1.0 rather than 21.1.249.\n- On 1.21.11 and newer, the roll readout on the debug screen is a line of its own instead of sitting inside the facing line. Those versions changed the debug screen so mods can only add lines to it."
